@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.38.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.38.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.38.0 (2026-11-24): The deliverable of scope change SC11_ExamResults is groomed into one story with an acceptance criterion and three tasks (build the template, rebuild the two pages, verify). Grooming comes before any build file."""@en .

ex:AC11_ExamResults a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "On the pages of chapters 10 and 11 the mock exam tab only holds starting and taking an exam, a separate Exam results tab lists every attempt and shows the score, the answers and the corrections of any attempt right after finishing, the same exam can be retaken without limit, nothing asks for a release code or for a student number before starting, and the page tests pass."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:ST11_ExamResults a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Mock exam and exam results are two functions; students see their results and answers"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD11 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC11_ExamResults ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK11_ExamResults_Template, ex:TK11_ExamResults_Pages, ex:TK11_ExamResults_Verify .
ex:TK11_ExamResults_Template a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Build the page template that moves the attempt list and the review into an Exam results tab, removes the release lock and the identity gate, and keeps the result file"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK11_ExamResults_Pages a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Rebuild the chapter 10 and chapter 11 pages on the new template, with a new page test that follows the new behaviour"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_ExamResults_Template .
ex:TK11_ExamResults_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run the full page tests of both pages and read the logs, including the exam checks"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_ExamResults_Pages .
